{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Replace the NHS in England with a universal health insurance system",
        "additional_details": "England should replace its NHS model with universal health insurance. Regulated insurers and competing healthcare providers would deliver essential healthcare, guaranteed to everyone regardless of income, age or pre-existing conditions. The system should promote patient choice, competition, efficiency and higher standards, with independent oversight, transparency and accountability. Government safeguards must ensure nobody is denied essential treatment because they cannot afford it.",
        "background": "Replace the NHS in England with a universal health insurance system, guaranteeing everyone access to essential healthcare regardless of income or pre-existing medical conditions.",
